=====================

RE: Case No. 2026-CV-38472
Court: Central District Court
Filing Date: March 8, 2026

Dear Defendant/Respondent,

You are hereby formally notified that a legal complaint has been filed against you. Failure to respond within the specified timeframe may result in a default judgment being entered against you.

CASE DETAILS:
- Plaintiff: ABC Financial Services Ltd.
- Nature: Contract Breach / Unpaid Obligations
- Amount Claimed: ¥158,400
- Filing Court: Central District Court

MANDATORY RESPONSE REQUIRED:
